  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nExpression: 5 - [1/2 ÷ {2/3 - (1/4 × (1/2 - 1/3))}]\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nSimplify inside parentheses first.\n\nApply order of operations (BODMAS).\n\nDivision: a ÷ b = a × (1/b).\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n5 - [1/2 ÷ {2/3 - (1/4 x (1/2 - 1/3))}]\n\n⇒ 5 - [1/2 ÷ {2/3 - (1/4 x (1/6))}]\n\n⇒ 5 - [1/2 ÷ {2/3 - 1/24)}]\n\n⇒ 5 - [1/2 ÷ {5/8)}]\n\n⇒ 5 - [1/2 × 8/5}]\n\n⇒ 5 - 4/5\n\n⇒ 21/5 = 4(1)/(5)\n\n**∴ The correct answer is 4(1)/(5).**",
